  "description": "Do you want to be sporty on your daily commute without sacrificing the versatility of a gravel bike? Then the Gravelliner probably ticks all your boxes. With flatbar handlebars, mudguards and lights, the trekking bike is fully suitable for everyday use, but has the genes of a gravel bike. With the Schwalbe G-One tyres, you can move sportily between asphalt, gravel and forest paths. The robust suspension fork absorbs undesirable riding influences with ease on everyday rides and tours. What remains is maximum versatility for all uses and challenges. Experience riding fun - every day and on tours.",
